<title>UK: Comm Union operating pretax profit falls.</title>
<headline>Comm Union operating pretax profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 43.5		  vs     52.8</p>
<p> Total dividend	    30.30		 vs    28.25</p>
<p> Pretax		     444.00		 vs   509.00</p>
<p> Turnover		 8,242.00		 vs 8,647.00</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast Commercial Union to report profits of 438 million stg..</p>
